<title>USA: Storm moving east to Sweden, Baltic - WSC.</title>
<headline>Storm moving east to Sweden, Baltic - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The storm currently in the Netherlands will move to southeast Sweden by late Thursday and strong winds in the English Channel and the southern North Sea will diminish, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>Strong winds may lead to problems in the Baltic during Thursday and Friday.</p>
